@model Profile
@*
    The hero's animated background (ADR-0008): lanes of scrolling code from the owner's own
    stack, with floating technology logos over them. It is the stronger twin of the faint
    layer fixed behind the whole page (see _Layout.cshtml), and both use the same lanes so
    the background looks continuous. Purely decorative, so it is hidden from assistive
    technology and never takes pointer events.

    The logos come from Profile.BackdropTags, and a content test requires each one to appear
    in the projects, roles or skills and to have a logo, so the background can never advertise
    a technology the rest of the page does not back up (ADR-0006).
*@
<div class="code-backdrop" aria-hidden="true">
    <partial name="_CodeStreams" model="@("hero")" />
    <partial name="_TechLogos" model="@(new TechLogosModel(Model.BackdropTags, "hero"))" />
</div>
